    Dashboard -->|monorepo| Turbo

    %% Platform connections
    Dashboard -->|all K8s ops| K8sAPI
    Dashboard -->|metrics| Thanos
    Dashboard -->|auth proxy| KRBP
    Dashboard -->|ingress| GatewayAPI

    %% Internal component connections
    RhodsOp -->|creates CR| Dashboard
    Dashboard -->|pipeline proxy| DSPipelines
    Dashboard -->|artifact mgmt| ModelReg
    Dashboard -->|CRD watch| KServe
    Dashboard -->|explainability| TrustyAI
    Dashboard -->|metadata proxy| MLMD
    Dashboard -->|dashboards| Perses
    Dashboard -->|CRD watch| Kueue
    Dashboard -->|admin groups| AuthCR

    %% AI/ML connections
    Dashboard -->|gen-ai chat| LlamaStack
    Dashboard -->|moderation| NeMo
    Dashboard -->|experiments| MLflowSvc
    Dashboard -->|model-as-a-service| MaaSAPI
    Dashboard -->|evaluation| EvalHubAPI
    Dashboard -->|pipeline orch| KFPipeline

    %% External connections
    Dashboard -->|file storage| S3
    Dashboard -->|vector DB| PGVector

    %% Consumer connections
    Dashboard -.->|ConsoleLink| OSConsole
    Dashboard -.->|CRD watch| OLM
    Dashboard -.->|CRD watch| Feast

